category: Libs
requires: cygwin libboost_program_options1.66 libboost_regex1.66 libboost_system1.66 libField3D1.7 libgcc1 libhdf5_320 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Library for storing voxel data on disk and in memory (utilities)"
ldesc: "Field3D is an open source library for storing voxel data. It provides C++
classes that handle in-memory storage and a file format based on HDF5 that
allows the C++ objects to be written to and read from disk."

